Output scroll-test.mp4

Set FontSize 42
Set Width 1080
Set Height 1350
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 45ms

Env PS1 "❯ "
Env PROMPT "❯ "

Hide
Type "clear"
Enter

Type "nvim scrolltest.md"
Enter
Sleep 1s

Escape
Sleep 300ms
Type "i"
Sleep 400ms
Show
Sleep 300ms

Type "# line 01"
Enter
Sleep 300ms
Type "line 02"
Enter
Sleep 300ms
Type "line 03"
Enter
Sleep 300ms
